{"id":"9002290c9f73fc3d077d4dacab73290d160e3e97","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1239255","title":"Cloudflare Tunnel 你们怎么用的？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"chenglus","excerpt":"问与答 - @chenglus - 用了一个多月了，感觉做穿透真香，免费而且还稳定，不过我目前也基本就是 SSH 操作一下家里的机器。想知道他的上限在哪？比如看看家里 NAS 的电影可行么？","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>用了一个多月了，感觉做穿透真香，免费而且还稳定，不过我目前也基本就是 SSH 操作一下家里的机器。</p>\n<p>想知道他的上限在哪？比如看看家里 NAS 的电影可行么？</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18047394\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/92e4/843a/24513_normal.png?m=1726545730\" alt=\"unneeded\" data-uid=\"24513\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/unneeded\">unneeded</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 16:35:47 +08:00\">19h 57m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>延迟太高了，我只拿来用作 IPv6 下的 wireguard/ssh tunnel 和 Surge Ponte 都失效后的备用</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18047417\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/10f62d96f45d9008cad3a775d18b924a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"LaFayette\" data-uid=\"235602\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/LaFayette\">LaFayette</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 16:40:30 +08:00\">19h 52m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>tunnel 是如何操作 ssh 的？ warp 在电信 4G 下根本连不上啊</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18047424\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e3271ff9902cf6552e437682c6d74442?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jamos\" data-uid=\"192294\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jamos\">jamos</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 16:41:21 +08:00\">19h 51m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>没那么完美，延迟高，有时还不可用</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18047453\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b3ed/03fa/371659_normal.png?m=1787037255\" alt=\"imyzt\" data-uid=\"371659\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/imyzt\">imyzt</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 16:45:40 +08:00\">19h 47m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>目前在用 tailscale + jellyfin ，局域网自动直连，外网通过打洞实现直连，效果还可以。cloudflare tunnel 只适合放点小东西穿透出来，视频体验太差。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18047525\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/64d6/6ac2/51170_normal.png?m=1784387864\" alt=\"Tink\" data-uid=\"51170\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Tink\">Tink</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 16:57:52 +08:00\">19h 35m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>看视频有点离谱，网页操作一下倒是没啥问题</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18047595\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/63fa/f984/508306_normal.png?m=1730102410\" alt=\"zCoCo\" data-uid=\"508306\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zCoCo\">zCoCo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 17:08:55 +08:00\">19h 24m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>速度太慢了，往出来代理家里的 web 服务还行，传输文件几十 KB/s 没法用</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18047855\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a0bc/c259/227469_normal.png?m=1764777062\" alt=\"ronman\" data-uid=\"227469\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ronman\">ronman</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 18:07:08 +08:00\">18h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>最多用来暴露一些 web 应用，像是 bitwarden 、路由器管理页面这种，看视频是想太多了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18048024\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/782f/6272/342338_normal.png?m=1780318925\" alt=\"chenglus\" data-uid=\"342338\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/chenglus\">chenglus</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 19:21:15 +08:00\">17h 12m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我试了一下，下载 300KB ，上传能把我的上传带宽打满，大概 5MB/s</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18048631\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2419/2ea5/418222_normal.png?m=1559542664\" alt=\"ShineyWang\" data-uid=\"418222\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ShineyWang\">ShineyWang</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-04 01:50:52 +08:00\">10h 42m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>家里有公网 IP ，作用有限<br>最多给 gpt 用用</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"用了一个多月了，感觉做穿透真香，免费而且还稳定，不过我目前也基本就是 SSH 操作一下家里的机器。 想知道他的上限在哪？比如看看家里 NAS 的电影可行么？ 1 unneeded 19h 57m ago 延迟太高了，我只拿来用作 IPv6 下的 wireguard/ssh tunnel 和 Surge Ponte 都失效后的备用 2 LaFayette 19h 52m ago tunnel 是如何操作 ssh 的？ warp 在电信 4G 下根本连不上啊 3 jamos 19h 51m ago 没那么完美，延迟高，有时还不可用 4 imyzt 19h 47m ago 目前在用 tailscale + jellyfin ，局域网自动直连，外网通过打洞实现直连，效果还可以。cloudflare tunnel 只适合放点小东西穿透出来，视频体验太差。 8 Tink 19h 35m ago 看视频有点离谱，网页操作一下倒是没啥问题 9 zCoCo 19h 24m ago 速度太慢了，往出来代理家里的 web 服务还行，传输文件几十 KB/s 没法用 10 ronman 18h 26m ago 最多用来暴露一些 web 应用，像是 bitwarden 、路由器管理页面这种，看视频是想太多了 11 chenglus OP 17h 12m ago 我试了一下，下载 300KB ，上传能把我的上传带宽打满，大概 5MB/s 12 ShineyWang 10h 42m ago via Android 家里有公网 IP ，作用有限最多给 gpt 用用","fetched_at":"2026-09-04T04:33:17.524Z","ok":true}